name multiexpand
category Package
revision 45943
shortdesc Variations on the primitive command \expandafter
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides two user commands; one that performs
longdesc multiple expansions, and one that does multiple \expandafter
longdesc operations, in a single macro call. The author suggests that
longdesc the same effect could be provided by use of the command variant
longdesc mechanisms of LaTeX 3 (see, for example, the interface
longdesc documentation of the experimental LaTeX 3 kernel).
